==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|id|en}} {{m|id|Sumatra}}, from {{etyl|sa|en}} {{m|sa|समुद्र||sea}}. Mentioned in the 11th century in Sanskrit as {{m|sa|समुद्रभूमि||land of Sumatra}}, gradually replacing the earlier ''svarna-dvīpa''.

===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun}}

# The largest island of [[Indonesia]].

